---
Usage: fj version [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <CONFIG>  Directory containing fj configuration and credentials [env: FORGEJO_CONFIG=]
  -H, --host <HOST>      Forgejo instance host or URL to use instead of auto-detection [env: FORGEJO_HOST]
      --token <TOKEN>    Forgejo API token to use instead of stored credentials [env: FORGEJO_TOKEN]
  -y, --yes              Skip all confirmation prompts (auto-confirm destructive actions)
  -v, --verbose          Show verbose output (API calls, resolution steps)
  -h, --help             Print help
